# PRESETS (1.1, LFO next / SEL last): thirteen palettes for the garden. Switching keeps the garden exactly (every
# plant, phrase, the gardener, the ledger); each makes sound, none clips; the preset is kept as a setting; 1.0's
# project (format 1) loads whole, as Cottage
wait 300
tapkey 5
tapkey 12
tapkey 20
wait 300000
expect living >2
expect preset 0
# frozen (time stops): every preset in turn, and round again; the garden as it was
tap REC
wait 500
snap
tap LFO
tap LFO
tap LFO
tap LFO
tap LFO
tap LFO
tap LFO
tap LFO
tap LFO
tap LFO
tap LFO
tap LFO
expect preset 12
expect same 1
tap LFO
expect preset 0
tap SEL
expect preset 12
expect same 1
tap LFO
tap REC
expect frozen 0
expect preset 0
# Cottage
expect preset 0
wait 4000
peakreset
wait 25000
expect peak_db_max -1
expect peak_db_min -35
expect living >0
expect day >0
# Zen
tap LFO
expect preset 1
# Zen: the player's Dorian made pentatonic (minor), a glass lead, the shimmer
expect pv20 7
expect pv32 >20
expect pv39 >20
wait 4000
peakreset
wait 25000
expect peak_db_max -1
expect peak_db_min -35
expect living >0
expect day >0
